# Life360

> Life360 is a family safety platform with an app for iOS and Android offering real-time location sharing, driving safety monitoring, and crash detection. Hardware products include Tile Bluetooth trackers for finding everyday items and a GPS pet tracker. Available at life360.com, Amazon, Best Buy, Target, and Walmart.

## App Features

- [Location Sharing](https://www.life360.com/location-sharing): Real-time GPS location for all family members
- [Driving Safety](https://www.life360.com/driving-safety): Driver safety scores, speed alerts, and trip history
- [Digital Safety](https://www.life360.com/digital-safety): Identity theft protection and dark web monitoring
- [Aging Parents](https://www.life360.com/aging-parents): Location and safety features for elderly family members
- [Emergency Assistance](https://www.life360.com/emergency-assistance): SOS alerts and crash detection with emergency response

