## Plans & Pricing

- [Free Plan](https://www.life360.com/plans-pricing): Core location sharing at no cost
- [Silver Plan](https://www.life360.com/plans-pricing): $7.79/month or $79.99/year — location sharing, crash detection, SOS alerts, up to 5 place alerts, 7-day location history, crime reports
- [Gold Plan](https://www.life360.com/plans-pricing): $14.99/month or $149.99/year — all Silver features plus unlimited place alerts, 30-day location history, individual driver reports, emergency dispatch, roadside assistance, free towing up to 5 miles, stolen phone protection up to $250, stolen funds reimbursement up to $25k
- [Platinum Plan](https://www.life360.com/plans-pricing): $24.99/month or $249.99/year — all Gold features plus ID theft protection, free towing up to 50 miles, stolen phone protection up to $500, stolen funds reimbursement up to $1M, credit monitoring, travel support

